==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Ribbo]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lowkey]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 40~45.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,360f</sup>.
**2 [[Dread Bore]]s spawn, delay 60~63.33 seconds<sup>1,800f~1,900f</sup>.
**5 [[Ribbo]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psycho Cat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] are both good for the starred aliens in the stage. [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Golfer Cat]] and [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kitty of Liberty]] can help with the Ribbos. [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] and [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Weedwacker Cat]] are also good choices for the Dread Bores. After you've killed both of the Dread Bores, chip down Lowkey with [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], or [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard]] if you have it. Awakened Bahamut Cat can also help to chip Lowkey in between the Dread Bore waves, although timing or the Thunderbolt Cannon may be required. If talented, Awakened Bahamut Cat can also do heavy damage to the initial Lowkey and Dread Bores when first hitting the enemy base.

[[:Talents|Talented]] [[Gravi (Uber Rare Cat)|Gravolodon]] can be especially useful on this stage, as it mainly consists of Relic and Alien enemies. Despite not having Zombie targeting, he can also tank the Dread Bores quite well.

==Trivia==
*Buried Hypocrisy is the only whose name has no relation to one from [[Dead End Night]].
*Buried Hypocrisy is the first [[Uncanny Legends]] stage to cost more than 250 [[Cat Energy|energy]].

